# kk-daily-publish3-overseas — overseas window behind the podcast RSS gate (tasks 0323 R5, 0334 R1-R2).
#
# 07:00 America/Los_Angeles, which needs no DST adjustment: the entry is defined in the zone the
# machine already runs in. The gated date is the PREVIOUS day, because the observed episodes land
# 13:43–15:22 PDT (after this tick) — the launcher derives yesterday's LA date for `run_date`.
#
# The gate decides whether anything publishes: a miss cancels the overseas targets and runs
# `diagnose` + the tier-0-only repair. This line carries no live consent; the overseas channels
# in the shipped preset are `draft`, so a live overseas post stays an operator launch.
#
# plugins/kk/scripts/voice3-publish-window.ts (task 0334) owns the date math because a crontab
# command ends at the first UNESCAPED percent sign — the old inline `date -v-1d +%Y%m%d` shell
# truncated silently. The launcher resolves the GENERATION bundle (voice2 namespace, effective
# works root) and refuses a missing/mismatched bundle before any spur process starts.
#
# Rendered by `kk schedule render kk-daily-publish3-overseas --platform cron --repo <checkout>`;
# kk never edits the operator's crontab. MERGE, never replace:
#
#     crontab -l > /tmp/kk-overseas.cron 2>/dev/null || :
#     kk schedule render kk-daily-publish3-overseas --platform cron --repo "$PWD" >> /tmp/kk-overseas.cron
#     crontab /tmp/kk-overseas.cron
0 7 * * * cd {{repo}} && mkdir -p .works/kk-daily-publish3 && PATH="{{home}}/.bun/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin" TZ=America/Los_Angeles bun {{repo}}/plugins/kk/scripts/voice3-publish-window.ts --window overseas-rss >> {{repo}}/.works/kk-daily-publish3/overseas.log 2>&1
